  "description": "BLACK FRIDAY UPGRADE OPTIONS LIVE BELOW! See specials in the description.\n\nRedesigned for 2026! The updated Timber 26 features new geometry, BOOST 12x148 rear wheel spacing, a Universal Derailleur Hanger (UDH), and a slick stealth Maxle system.\n\nThe Timber 26 is a lightweight 26-inch mountain bike for kids who are ready to move up from a 24-inch bike but aren't quite ready for an adult frame. With new-school geometry, a SUPER low 24-inch standover height, and builds starting at just 23 pounds, this bike helps young riders level up their trail skills without the weight or bulk of a full-size adult bike.",
